IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROXY-TEST-SUITE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 TEST-CASE-1      PIC X(100) VALUE "CLIENT00100005000".
01 TEST-CASE-2      PIC X(100) VALUE "CLIENT00200099999".
01 RESULT-BUFFER    PIC X(50).
PROCEDUERE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "--- TEST 1: SMALL AMOUNT ---".
    MOVE TEST-CASE-1 TO INPUT-BUFFER.
    PERFORM PROCESS-LOGIC.
    
    DISPLAY "--- TEST 2: LARGE AMOUNT ---".
    MOVE TEST-CASE-2 TO INPUT-BUFFER.
    PERFORM PROCESS-LOGIC.
    STOP RUN.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
01 INPUT-BUFFER     PIC X(100).
01 OUTPUT-RESULT    PIC X(50).

PROCESS-LOGIC.
    ACCEPT INPUT-BUFFER FROM STANDARD IN.
    IF INPUT-BUFFER(11:7) > 1000000
        MOVE "REJECTED" TO OUTPUT-RESULT
    ELSE
        MOVE "APPROVED" TO OUTPUT-RESULT
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY "RESULT: " OUTPUT-RESULT.